types of class
Normal / Concrete Class – A regular class with implementation.it is used to create the objects.



Abstract Class – A class declared using the abstract keyword.



Final Class – A class declared using the final keyword; it cannot be inherited.



Nested Class – A class declared inside another class.



Static Nested Class – A static class declared inside another class.



Inner Class – A non-static class declared inside another class.
